{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56718","headline":"钴鉧潭 · 无名氏","name":"钴鉧潭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常闻南郭智，未识北山愚。\n试问溪中水，潺潺只自如。\n（见道光《永州府志》卷十八《金石略》、同治《湖南通志》卷二六四《金石》六。\n）（按：诗後署「癸酉中冬既望日□□□□过永州□□」。\n〖1〗《湖南通志》附引钱邦芑《游记》疑爲柳子厚作，《嘉庆通志》以爲非柳作，「殆後人所题也」。\n《金石补正》谓「以笔意审之，当是宋人所题」。\n「诗句颇似邢恕，疑是元佑癸酉，然无可证，姑系诸宋末，俟考。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}